{"sha": "6b01490da9b222dae27355509b616999aa66db793cd64654a46825486304d6ee", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:waves-in-media} 章 --- 电磁波在等离子体、导体和电介质中的传播}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-in-media:1}", "$f_p \\approx 9\\sqrt n$ Hz：\\qty{2.8}{MHz}、\\qty{9}{MHz}、\\qty{9}{GHz}、\\qty{2.6e15}{Hz}", "($\\lambda_p = \\qty{115}{nm}$)、\\qty{2.8}{kHz}。调幅 \\qty{1}{MHz}：仅能穿过", "星际空间。调频：穿过电离层，不能穿过鞘层。GPS：", "除鞘层外均可通过。光：除铜外均可通过。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-in-media:2}", "铜：\\qty{9.2}{mm}、\\qty{2.1}{mm}、\\qty{65}{\\micro m}、\\qty{2.1}{\\micro m}；铝在", "\\qty{1}{MHz} 时为 \\qty{84}{\\micro m}；海水：\\qty{10}{kHz} 时为 \\qty{2.3}{m}，", "\\qty{1}{GHz} 时为 \\qty{7}{mm}；土壤：\\qty{1}{MHz} 时为 \\qty{5}{m}。潜艇位于 \\qty{10}{m} 深处时需要 $\\delta", "\\gtrsim \\qty{10}{m}$：频率须低于约 \\qty{500}{Hz}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-in-media:3}", "$n = 1.528$、$1.515$、$1.509$；$v = 1.963$、$1.980$、$\\qty{1.987e8}{m/s}$；$n_g = n +", "2B/\\lambda^2 = 1.545$。折射角 $\\arcsin(0.707/n)$：\\qty{27.57}{\\degree} 与", "\\qty{27.93}{\\degree}：散布为 \\qty{0.36}{\\degree}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-in-media:4}", "$f_p = \\qty{4.0}{MHz}$：\\qty{5}{MHz} 可通过；\\qty{2}{MHz} 被反射，穿透深度为", "$c/\\sqrt{\\omega_p^2 - \\omega^2} = \\qty{14}{m}$。当 $n = \\qty{1.5e12}{m^{-3}}$ 时：\\qty{11}{MHz}。密度", "随太阳电离通量变化——随小时、季节以及", "十一年周期而变，因此最高可用频率也随之改变。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-in-media:5}", "(a) $1/\\gamma\\pi a^2 = \\qty{5.3}{m\\ohm/m}$。(b) $\\delta = \\qty{65}{\\micro m}$；$R \\approx 1/\\gamma2\\pi a\\delta", "= \\qty{41}{m\\ohm/m}$，为直流时的 $7.7$ 倍。(c) $\\delta = \\qty{6.5}{\\micro m}$，\\qty{0.41}{\\ohm/m}，", "为 $77$ 倍。(d) 集肤效应占主导后，$R \\propto \\sqrt f$ 与 $L\\omega$ 增长得一样快，", "且每匝都会增加电阻；利兹线由许多", "彼此绝缘、直径小于 $\\delta$ 的细股线绞合而成，因而整根铜线都参与导电。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-in-media:6}", "$\\delta_{\\text{Al}} = 11.9$、$0.84$、\\qty{0.084}{mm}：$d/\\delta = 0.08$、$1.2$、$12$：$0.7$、", "$10$、\\qty{103}{dB}。在 \\qty{50}{Hz} 时该导体是透明的；高", "$\\mu_r$ 的铁会使磁通发生偏转（磁屏蔽），并使 $\\delta$ 缩小为", "原来的 $\\sqrt{\\mu_r}$ 分之一。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-in-media:7}", "(a) $v_0 = eE_0/m\\omega$；$\\tfrac12nm\\langle v^2\\rangle = ne^2E_0^2/4m\\omega^2 = \\tfrac14\\varepsilon_0", "E_0^2\\,\\omega_p^2/\\omega^2$。(b) $\\tfrac14\\varepsilon_0E_0^2$ 与 $\\tfrac14\\varepsilon_0E_0^2(1 - \\omega_p^2/", "\\omega^2)$。(c) 二者之和为 $\\tfrac12\\varepsilon_0E_0^2$（括号内为 $1$）；$\\langle\\Pi", "\\rangle = E_0^2k/2\\mu_0\\omega$，两者之比为 $c^2k/\\omega = v_g$。(d) $\\tfrac14\\cdot\\tfrac14", "/\\tfrac12 = 1/8$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-in-media:8}", "(a) $1/v_g = (1/c)(1 - \\omega_p^2/\\omega^2)^{-1/2} \\approx (1 + \\omega_p^2/2\\omega^2)/c$。(b) $\\Delta t", "= (L\\omega_p^2/2c)(1/\\omega_1^2 - 1/\\omega_2^2)$，其中 $\\omega_p^2 = ne^2/\\varepsilon_0m$，$\\omega =", "2\\pi f$：常数 $e^2/8\\pi^2\\varepsilon_0mc = \\qty{1.34e-7}{}$（SI）。(c) $nL = \\qty{9.3e23}{m^{-2}}$，", "$(1/f_1^2 - 1/f_2^2) = \\qty{5.7e-18}{s^2}$：$\\Delta t = \\qty{0.72}{s}$。(d) 柱积分量 $nL$", "（色散量），由此可由 $n$ 的模型求得距离。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-in-media:9}", "(a) $\\operatorname{Im}\\underline\\chi = \\omega_p^2\\Gamma\\omega/[(\\omega_0^2 - \\omega^2)^2 + \\Gamma^2\\omega^2]$，其中", "$\\omega_0^2 - \\omega^2 \\approx 2\\omega_0(\\omega_0 - \\omega)$：$n'' = \\tfrac12\\operatorname{Im}\\underline\\chi$ 即为", "所给的洛伦兹线型。(b) $n''(\\omega_0) = \\omega_p^2/2\\omega_0\\Gamma$，$\\alpha = 2n''\\omega_0/c =", "\\omega_p^2/\\Gamma c$。(c) $\\omega_p^2 = \\qty{3.2e20}{s^{-2}}$：$\\alpha = \\qty{1.8e4}{m^{-1}}$；", "$\\ln10/\\alpha = \\qty{0.13}{mm}$。(d) $n' - 1 \\propto (\\omega_0 - \\omega)/[(\\omega_0 - \\omega)^2 +", "\\Gamma^2/4]$：在谱线以下为正，以上为负，在 $\\pm\\Gamma/2$", "谱线两侧范围内递减——该处为反常色散。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-in-media:10}", "(a) $\\underline E = E_0\\eu^{-x/\\delta}\\eu^{\\iu(\\omega t - x/\\delta)}$，$\\underline B = \\underline k\\underline E/\\omega", "= (1 - \\iu)\\underline E/\\omega\\delta$。(b) $\\langle\\Pi_x\\rangle = \\tfrac12\\operatorname{Re}(\\underline E", "\\underline B^*)/\\mu_0 = E_0^2/2\\mu_0\\omega\\delta$（$x = 0$ 处）。(c) $\\int_0^\\infty\\tfrac12\\gamma E_0^2", "\\eu^{-2x/\\delta}\\dd x = \\gamma E_0^2\\delta/4 = E_0^2/2\\mu_0\\omega\\delta$，其中用到 $\\gamma = 2/\\mu_0\\omega\\delta^2$。", "(d) $H_0 = \\sqrt2E_0/\\mu_0\\omega\\delta$，因此 $\\tfrac12R_sH_0^2 = E_0^2/\\gamma\\mu_0^2\\omega^2\\delta^3 =", "E_0^2/2\\mu_0\\omega\\delta$。铜在 \\qty{1}{GHz} 时：$R_s = 1/\\gamma\\delta = \\qty{8}{m\\ohm}$；", "$\\tfrac12 \\times 8 \\times 10^{-3} \\times 10^4 = \\qty{40}{W/m^2}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-in-media:11}", "(a) $\\omega_p = \\qty{1.4e16}{rad/s}$，$\\lambda_p = 2\\pi c/\\omega_p = \\qty{140}{nm}$。(b) $\\omega = \\qty{3.8e15}{rad/s}", "< \\omega_p$：$1/\\kappa = c/\\sqrt{\\omega_p^2 - \\omega^2} = \\qty{23}{nm}$，发生全反射。(c)", "仍低于 $\\omega_p$：发生反射；仅当波长超过 \\qty{140}{nm} 时才能透过（在", "钠中为 \\qty{210}{nm}）。(d) 碰撞使 $\\underline\\gamma$ 获得实部，并产生", "百分之几的吸收；可见光波段的束缚电子共振", "（金、铜）吸收蓝光，使金属呈色。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:waves-in-media:12}", "(a) $\\omega\\tau = 0.12$：$\\underline\\varepsilon_r = 84 - 9.7\\iu$；在 \\qty{20}{GHz} 时，$\\omega\\tau = 1$：", "$45 - 40\\iu$。(b) $\\underline n \\approx 9.2 - 0.53\\iu$；$c/2n''\\omega = \\qty{1.8}{cm}$：微波炉加热", "外层两厘米，其余部分靠热传导加热。(c) $\\tfrac12 \\times", "1.54 \\times 10^{10} \\times 8.85 \\times 10^{-12} \\times 9.7 \\times 4 \\times 10^6 = \\qty{2.6}{MW/m^3}$。(d) 在", "\\qty{20}{GHz} 时吸收长度仅为一毫米：仅表层", "会被加热；\\qty{2.45}{GHz} 可穿透，且为免许可频段。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:waves-in-media:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $f_p = \\qty{9}{MHz}$：GPS 可通过，短波被反射。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $k = (\\omega/c)\\sqrt{1 - \\omega_p^2/\\omega^2}$：$v_\\varphi = \\omega/k \\approx c(1 + \\omega_p^2/", "2\\omega^2)$，$v_g = \\dd\\omega/\\dd k = c^2k/\\omega \\approx c(1 - \\omega_p^2/2\\omega^2)$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $\\Delta t = \\int(1/v_g - 1/c)\\dd z = \\int\\omega_p^2\\dd z/2c\\omega^2 = e^2N_T/2\\varepsilon_0", "mc\\omega^2 = (e^2/8\\pi^2\\varepsilon_0mc)N_T/f^2 = 1.34 \\times 10^{-7} \\times 2 \\times 10^{17}/2.48 \\times", "10^{18} = \\qty{11}{ns}$：\\qty{3.2}{m}。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $N_T = (\\Delta t_1 - \\Delta t_2)/K(1/f_1^2 - 1/f_2^2)$；两者之差为", "\\qty{7}{ns}：$1\\%$ 需要 \\qty{0.07}{ns}。", ""]}